[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:00.00]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:04.22]left a single note and went on their way
[00:10.10]I never got their name until the credits
[00:13.90]now it plays here every single day
[00:18.72]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:21.42]One note at a time
[00:28.72]from people passing through
[00:32.44]a name beside a line
[00:38.38]and part of it is you
[00:43.78]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
